{"t":"2026-09-27T02:57:12.472Z","kind":"model","text":"{\"action\":\"note\",\"text\":\"SE meadow (x1070-1150, z1080-1150) is mostly free, nothing tall, no large structure. I'll build there: a 'Long Light' — a low horizontal lantern terrace running east-west, stepped stone plinth, light blocks in a long band (night view priority), glass skylight, moss edges, asymmetric. Keep footprint modest (~20x8). Respond to neighbours: face the river/Parliament across the meadow.\"}","ms":31455,"tokensIn":8990,"tokensOut":115}
